# Title: HackTool - SharpLdapWhoami Execution
# ID: d9367cbb-c2e0-47ce-bdc0-128cb6da898d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-29
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1033, car.2016-03-001
# Description: Detects SharpLdapWhoami, a whoami alternative that queries the LDAP service on a domain controller
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:* /method:ntlm OR process.command_line:* /method:kerb OR process.command_line:* /method:nego OR process.command_line:* /m:nego OR process.command_line:* /m:ntlm OR process.command_line:* /m:kerb)) OR (process.executable:*\\SharpLdapWhoami.exe) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:*SharpLdapWhoami*) OR (Product:"SharpLdapWhoami")))
